0.596.50Both claims employ neural networks for data-driven predictions and real-time decision-making and transform abstract data into actionable insights. In particular, both claim to train a neural network by a specifically claimed method, both apply the neural network, and both conclude with a final step that is a result of the application of the trained neural network.
